# AmChase12 workspace

This folder is one independent GitHub repository under AmChase12. Edit only the repository that owns the task. Touch a second repository only when the task names both, or when careers and the command center share `careers_applications` on the same Supabase project.

## Route the work

| Task | Repository |
|---|---|
| Northstar OS, Client OS, Inner Circle, HQ, hiring admin, iOS shell | `northstardigitalcommandcenter` |
| Public careers / applicant portal | `northstar-careers` |
| Northstar marketing Next.js source | `northstar-site` |
| Live northstardigi.agency GoHighLevel site | Not auto-deployed from `northstar-site` main. Open PRs #1 and #3 hold `ghl-site/`. Merging main does not publish GHL. |
| Privacy / Terms (SMS, A2P) | `northstar-legal` (GitHub Pages) |
| Setter field manual | `setter-manual` |
| Agency operating notes | `northstar-vault` |
| Agents operator console | `agents-21b9c6c5` |
| August 2026 Agents prototype | `Agents` — keep. Do not deploy over the live console. Do not archive unless asked. |
| Conductor follow-up drafts | `conductor-brain` (writes the Agents Supabase project). The production workflow is currently disabled on GitHub. |
| LeadFlow / Leadpad dialer | No AmChase12 repository. External Supabase project `xmjlwfprptglrldfxrha`. Do not create `leadflow-pro`. |
| Echelon Auto Studio site | `echelon` |
| FlipTrack Garage product | `fliptrackgarage`. The string `fliptrack-garage` is the in-app MCP server name, not a second GitHub repo. Do not create `fliptrack-garage`. |
| Green Water Aviation | `greenwater` |
| Personal finance notes | `finance-vault` — never deploy, never mix into a product PR |

## Production surfaces (do not treat a feature branch as live)

- Lovable syncs the connected branch (`main`) for `northstardigitalcommandcenter`, `agents-21b9c6c5`, and `fliptrackgarage`.
- `conductor-brain` `main` is a scheduled production job **when the workflow is enabled**.
- `northstar-legal` GitHub Pages builds from this repository.
- Echelon, careers, setter-manual, and greenwater are Netlify-oriented static/export sites. Still use pull requests.
- GraphSift 4.14.0 in this environment is **read-only** and currently indexes only `northstar-site`. Do not reconfigure that MCP server. Do not point it at `finance-vault` or `northstar-vault`.

## Requires explicit owner approval

- Merge to `main` on a Lovable, GitHub Pages, or conductor repository
- Enable, disable, or edit the Conductor Brain workflow
- Branch protection, DNS, Netlify production, Lovable publish, GoHighLevel publish, or Supabase schema
- Create, delete, or rename repositories
- Archive `Agents`
- Shared-database migrations
